Adapt test_super to load under Monty while keeping native unittest discovery.
Remove the cases that require syntax Monty cannot parse: metaclasses, decorated methods, del, and class-body global/nonlocal.
Restore the shared classmethod fixtures and the threading guard on CPython.
Use exec for an isolated global shadow and for temporary rebinding in the suite module, without unittest.mock or test.support on Monty.

